<report>
<line><title>Gini coefficient of inequality</title></line>
<block name="data">
<line></line>
<line><subtitle>Analysis for <in>ti</in>:</subtitle></line>
<line></line>
<line>Positive non-zero observations = <in>n</in>  <warn><in>msg</in></warn></line>
<line>Variance coefficient = <inu>cv</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line>Re-samples = <in>boots</in></line>
<line>Bias = <inu>bias</inu></line>
<line>Standard error (bootstrap) = <inu>se</inu></line>
<line></line>
<line>Gini coefficient = <inu>gini</inu></line>
<line><ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci></line>
<line><ci>BCa <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>BCafrom</inu> to <inu>BCato</inu></ci></line>
<line></line>
<line>Unbiased estimator of population Gini coefficient = <inu>gini-unbiased</inu></line>
<line><ci>Percentile <in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from-unbiased</inu> to <inu>to-unbiased</inu></ci></line>
